Review System

Reviews are only allowed after a completed transaction.

Buyers rate farmers on:

Apple quality
Freshness
Packaging
Quantity accuracy
Communication
Overall satisfaction

Each category uses a 1–5 star rating.

Buyers may also leave a written review.

Only verified buyers who completed a deal can review a farmer.

AI Reputation Summary

The AI should not determine apple quality from images or invent ratings.

Instead, it should summarize verified buyer feedback and transaction history.

Example output:

Trust Score: 93/100

AI Summary

This farmer has completed 54 verified sales. Buyers consistently praise the freshness of the apples, accurate grading, and reliable communication. Most deliveries match the listed quantity and quality.

If reviews show recurring issues:

Recent buyers reported inconsistent grading across several orders. Buyers should review the latest feedback before purchasing.

The AI summary should always be based only on real reviews and completed transactions.

