Success Criteria

The MVP is successful if:

A farmer can create an account and list apples in under 5 minutes.
A verified buyer can discover listings, compare sellers, and submit an offer in under 3 minutes.
Farmers receive multiple offers from different buyers.
Buyers can confidently choose sellers based on verified reviews and AI-generated reputation summaries.
The platform feels trustworthy, simple, and significantly reduces the need for middlemen in the initial buying process.